OL,3,ALegendary video game studio BioWare
OL,4,Acloses after 31 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBioWare, the video game studio behind
OL,7,Fsci-fi epic Mass Effect and fantasy
OL,8,Fsaga Dragon Age, has been closed down.
OL,10,FThe Canadian developer specialising in
OL,11,Frole-playing games was founded in 1995
OL,12,Fand found millions of fans with its
OL,13,Fcomplex, branching narratives.
OL,15,FIts last two releases, however, did not
OL,16,Fmeet sales expectations, and parent
OL,17,Fcompany Electronic Arts (EA) announced
OL,18,Fit had decided to close the studio as
OL,19,Fit cut 400 jobs across the business.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
