OL,3,ALegendary video game studio BioWare
OL,4,Acloses after 31 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn its own statement, BioWare, which
OL,7,Fwas working on a new Mass Effect game,
OL,8,Fthanked players for "being the most
OL,9,Fimportant part of the story" during its
OL,10,F31-year history.
